There must be no hidden route by which one fighter gets faster normal locomotion.

Choose the cleanest architecture after inspecting all consumers.

If Speed Power and Jump Power no longer have a meaningful gameplay purpose after baseline normalization, either remove/collapse them cleanly or redesign their role. Do not preserve obsolete complexity solely because it already exists.

If they remain visible in Discover/documentation, the UI must not falsely imply that #0002 receives superior base running speed.

